These patches and overlays are part of (and derived from) the Linux kernel, covered by the GPLv2 license.
They were originally sourced from the openSUSE `raspberrypi-firmware-dt` SRPM
(https://build.opensuse.org/package/show/hardware:boot/raspberrypi-firmware-dt).
They are maintained in this repository to match the `raspberrypi_kernel_version`
in the root `Pkgfile` and include local compatibility adjustments.
